- @Doggy_Fi creates MetaMask Snap, which allows you to manage Dogecoin assets (Doginals/DRC-20/Dunes) with only MetaMask

@jakegallen_ @JussCubs @Doggy_Fi Now you don't need a separate wallet to trade Doginals/DRC20/Dunes, thanks to Dogecoin Snap you only need MetaMask. This should significantly reduce the barrier to entry into the ecosystem.

